>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"16,5,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"16,5,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Machel Montano<\/b> \u2013 <i data-path-to-node=\"16,5,0\" data-index-in-node=\"17\">Happiest Man Alive<\/i>, <i data-path-to-node=\"16,5,0\" data-index-in-node=\"37\">Like Ah Boss<\/i><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"16,6,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"16,6,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Nigel &amp; Marvin Lewis<\/b> \u2013 <i data-path-to-node=\"16,6,0\" data-index-in-node=\"23\">Follow The Leader<\/i><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"16,7,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"16,7,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">The Merrymen<\/b> \u2013 <i data-path-to-node=\"16,7,0\" data-index-in-node=\"15\">Get Something and Wave<\/i><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"17\" \/>\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"18\">\ud83c\udfb8 Reggae-Pop &amp; Global Fusion<\/h2>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"19\"><i data-path-to-node=\"19\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Popular songs with that unmistakable island chop.<\/i><\/p>\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"20\">\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"20,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"20,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">98 Degrees<\/b> \u2013 <i data-path-to-node=\"20,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"13\">Give Me Just One Night (Una Noche)<\/i><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"20,1,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"20,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Afroman<\/b> \u2013 <i data-path-to-node=\"20,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"10\">Because I Got High<\/i><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"20,2,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"20,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Inner Circle<\/b> \u2013 <i data-path-to-node=\"20,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"15\">Sweat (A La La La La Long)<\/i>, <i data-path-to-node=\"20,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"43\">Bad Boys<\/i><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"20,3,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"20,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Magic!<\/b> \u2013 <i data-path-to-node=\"20,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"9\">Rude<\/i><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"20,4,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"20,4,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Maxi Priest<\/b> \u2013 <i data-path-to-node=\"20,4,0\" data-index-in-node=\"14\">Close to You<\/i>, <i data-path-to-node=\"20,4,0\" data-index-in-node=\"28\">Wild World<\/i><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"20,5,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"20,5,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Sean Kingston<\/b> \u2013 <i data-path-to-node=\"20,5,0\" data-index-in-node=\"16\">Beautiful Girls<\/i>, <i data-path-to-node=\"20,5,0\" data-index-in-node=\"33\">Take You There<\/i><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"20,6,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"20,6,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">UB40<\/b> \u2013 <i data-path-to-node=\"20,6,0\" data-index-in-node=\"7\">Red Red Wine<\/i>, <i data-path-to-node=\"20,6,0\" data-index-in-node=\"21\">Can&#8217;t Help Falling In Love<\/i><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"20,7,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"20,7,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Wyclef Jean<\/b> \u2013 <i data-path-to-node=\"20,7,0\" data-index-in-node=\"14\">Sweetest Girl (Dollar Bill)<\/i>, <i data-path-to-node=\"20,7,0\" data-index-in-node=\"43\">Guantanamera<\/i><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<hr data-path-to-node=\"21\" \/>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"22\">\ud83c\udf9a\ufe0f Build &amp; Transition<\/h3>\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"23\">\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"23,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"23,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Warm Up:<\/b> Start with <b data-path-to-node=\"23,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"20\">Roots &amp; South Pacific<\/b> (Marley \u2794 Fiji \u2794 J Boog).<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"23,1,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"23,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">The Bridge:<\/b> Move into <b data-path-to-node=\"23,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"22\">Reggae-Pop<\/b> (UB40 \u2794 Sean Kingston) to get the casual listeners singing along.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"23,2,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"23,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">The Peak:<\/b> Smash the <b data-path-to-node=\"23,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"20\">Dancehall &amp; Soca<\/b> (Sean Paul \u2794 Machel Montano) when the energy needs to hit 100%.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"23,3,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"23,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">The Bass Drop:<\/b> Use your <b data-path-to-node=\"23,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"24\">Dubstep-Reggae<\/b> tracks (like Damian Marley\/Skrillex&#8217;s <i data-path-to-node=\"23,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"77\">Make It Bun Dem<\/i>)\u00a0 Transition into the heavier electronic sounds<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>Songlist \u2013 Music Categories<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul style=\"text-align: left;\">\n<li><a href=\"https:\/\/www.californiadiscjockey.com\/songlist\/50s\/\">50s<\/a><\/li>\n<li><a href=\"https:\/\/www.californiadiscjockey.com\/songlist\/60s\/\">60s<\/a><\/li>\n<li><a href=\"https:\/\/www.californiadiscjockey.com\/songlist\/70s\/\">70\u2032s<\/a><\/li>\n<li><a href=\"https:\/\/www.californiadiscjockey.com\/songlist\/80s\/\">80\u2032s<\/a><\/li>\n<li><a href=\"https:\/\/www.californiadiscjockey.com\/songlist\/90s\/\">90\u2032s<\/a><\/li>\n<li><a href=\"https:\/\/www.californiadiscjockey.com\/songlist\/ballroom\/\">Ballroom Music<\/a><\/li>\n<li><a href=\"https:\/\/www.californiadiscjockey.com\/songlist\/big-band\/\">Big Band Music<\/a><\/li>\n<li><a href=\"https:\/\/www.californiadiscjockey.com\/songlist\/cocktail\/\">Cocktail Music<\/a><\/li>\n<li><a href=\"https:\/\/www.californiadiscjockey.com\/songlist\/country\/\">Country Music<\/a><\/li>\n<li><a href=\"https:\/\/www.californiadiscjockey.com\/songlist\/disco\/\">Disco Music<\/a><\/li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.californiadiscjockey.com\/songlist\/first-dance-songlist\/\">First\u00a0Dance Songlist<\/a><\/li>\n<li><a href=\"https:\/\/www.californiadiscjockey.com\/songlist\/group\/\">Group Music<\/a><\/li>\n<li><a href=\"https:\/\/www.californiadiscjockey.com\/songlist\/latin\/\">Latin<\/a><\/li>\n<li><a href=\"https:\/\/www